{"5124340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unsealed: Vigil", "steam_appid": 5124340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/10e7e0b27a236eba1ac2358b2fcc3d5f.webp?t=1788080795\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a nightmare realm where memory, trauma, and emotion manifest as a horrifying reality,  <br>you are a new soul trapped inside. Find your way out before the nightmare consumes you. <br><strong> </strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/508d6e976b8e4a494bbae685579f5dba.webp?t=1788080795\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If something is in the room with you, don't move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are strapped into an old wheelchair. You hold two things: a <strong>flashlight</strong>, and a <strong>small bell</strong>. <br>When you think you're not alone, <strong>find them, send them away</strong> before they get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/2ea9cfb15ea6f3f6670be0f9154b7a69.webp?t=1788080795\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/398437890a4bf0dc7ddc40a84531b217.poster.avif?t=1788080795\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/398437890a4bf0dc7ddc40a84531b217.webm?t=1788080795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/398437890a4bf0dc7ddc40a84531b217.mp4?t=1788080795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Find them, be quick... </i>They move closer when you're not looking.  <br>Listen. When you believe they're gone, move on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/d12bb8dcb3a5715508bef1798c97f97f.webp?t=1788080795\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/d322d485030d4f5d9abf99a20ec7cb1e.poster.avif?t=1788080795\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/d322d485030d4f5d9abf99a20ec7cb1e.webm?t=1788080795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5124340/extras/d322d485030d4f5d9abf99a20ec7cb1e.mp4?t=1788080795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Escape the nightmares, each with its own place, challenges, horrors.<br>Every nightmare introduces something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Not everything hunting you can be survived the same way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------